		{
			dependencies: ["7547756221DFC688"]
			description: ["The &6UHV Circuit Assembler&r is the first assembler that can put together the circuits UHV machines are made of. A UHV hull, UV components and the cleanroom you already run; the UV circuits keep feeding it. The optical assembly and the wetware mainframe on the rows below, and every controller of this era. Boards and chips arrive from the cleanroom by ME; keep a stock of what it returns."]
			icon: "gtceu:uhv_circuit_assembler"
