		{
			dependencies: ["1DEA3F88969A67A0"]
			description: ["GTM adds a UHV hull and UHV hatches but no UHV arm, sensor or emitter, so every UHV controller is built from UV parts and UHV circuits. The UV robot arms, sensors and emitters you already make, and the UHV circuits made here. The controllers of the machines chapter, in the order it lists them. Stock each UV part by ME; the assembler draws two of the kind a controller asks for."]
