			title: "Optical Assembly"
			x: 12.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7547756221DFC688"]
			description: ["An &6InP Wafer&r is the substrate a mid-infrared laser is grown on. Its lattice matches the layers the molecular beam reactor lays down. An InP boule from the crystal growth furnace, indium and red phosphorus, and the cleanroom. The quantum cascade laser next to it. The boule is slow. Keep indium and phosphorus topped up by ME and stock the wafers."]
			icon: "grindless:inp_wafer"
			id: "5432C6DC48ECC9A5"
			rewards: [{ id: "5B4F99C30AA8F734", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
