		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7547756221DFC688"]
			description: ["Neurons grown on a chitosan scaffold in ultrapure water make an &6Organoid Processor&r, tissue that learns on a board. The organoid array, stem cells from UV's vat, a scaffold, ultrapure water and sterile growth medium. The wetware mainframe, four organoids at a time. Medium and water by pipe; a tissue line fed by ME runs without a hand."]
			icon: "grindless:organoid_processor"
