		{
			dependencies: ["104D06696418C335", "18F76220739031F7"]
			description: ["The &6Wetware Processor Mainframe&r is the UHV circuit. The organoid array makes four at once from organoid processors, neurons and an optical assembly. Four organoid processors, neuro processing units, an SiC power module and an optical assembly for each batch. Every UHV controller, and the hull of this era. Run the array in batches of four by ME and keep a dedicated mainframe chest."]
			icon: "gtceu:wetware_processor_mainframe"
			id: "5EF940CA680ECC5C"
